        "Content": "Make the right move with your #1 Agency!\r\n\r\nModern A-Rated Family Home\r\n\r\nLocated in the charming coastal village of Termonfeckin, just 6km from Drogheda and only a short drive from the M1 motorway, this superb home offers an exceptional opportunity for families seeking modern living in a highly desirable location.\r\n\r\nBuilt in 2021 and presented in impeccable show house condition throughout, the property combines contemporary design with spacious and practical accommodation. Carefully maintained by its current owner since new, every aspect of the home showcases quality, comfort, and attention to detail.\r\n\r\nThe bright and welcoming entrance hall leads to a spacious sitting room, a stylish open-plan kitchen, dining and living area, together with a convenient guest WC/utility room on the ground floor. Upstairs, the property boasts three generous bedrooms, including a master bedroom with en-suite, as well as a modern family bathroom.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property benefits from ample off-street parking to the front. The rear garden is laid in lawn, enclosed by timber-panel fencing, creating an ideal space for outdoor entertaining and family enjoyment.\r\n\r\nWith its excellent energy efficiency, thoughtful layout and turnkey condition, this outstanding property is ready for immediate occupation and will undoubtedly appeal to a wide range of purchasers.\r\n\r\nAccommodation\r\n\r\nGround Floor\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall\r\nSitting Room: 4.12m x 3.73m\r\nKitchen/Dining/Living Area: 6.71m x 5.81m\r\nUtility Room / WC: 1.95m x 1.98m\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: 4.12m x 3.71m\r\nEn-Suite: 1.61m x 2.00m\r\nBedroom 2: 3.96m x 2.95m\r\nBedroom 3: 3.51m x 2.76m\r\nFamily Bathroom: 1.80m x 2.95m\r\nKey Features\r\nBuilt in 2021\r\nBER A2\r\nAir-to-water heat pump heating system\r\nThree bedrooms with master en-suite\r\nSpacious open-plan kitchen/dining/living area\r\nGuest WC/utility room\r\nAmple off-street parking\r\nTurnkey show house condition\r\nConvenient location close to Drogheda, beaches, schools and the M1 motorway\r\nServices\r\nMains Water\r\nMains Sewage\r\nMains Electricity\r\nAir-to-Water Heat Pump Heating\r\nBER\r\n\r\nBER Rating: A2\r\n(Certificate available on request)\r\n\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate everything this beautiful home has to offer. Contact Ciaran for further information or to arrange a viewing."
